	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『ダンボール戦機』より、天使と悪魔、二つの顔を併せ持つ「LBXルシファー」がハイパーファンクションシリーズから登場！",
			"• 精密なメカディテールがほどこされたコアスケルトンを内蔵。",
			"• コアスケルトンの関節は驚異の可動域を確保。様々なアクションポーズを再現できる。",
			"• 多色成形で再現された各装甲は着脱でき、組み上げるだけでカラフルな機体を再現可能。",
			"• 背面のビーム翼はクリアパーツで再現。"
		],
		"en": [
			"From \"Danball Senki\", \"LBX Lucifer\", who has two faces, an angel and a devil, is now available from the Hyper Function series!",
			"• Built-in core skeleton with precise mechanical details.",
			"• The core skeleton joints have an amazing range of motion. You can reproduce various action poses.",
			"• Each armor reproduced with multi-colored molding can be attached and removed, allowing you to recreate a colorful aircraft just by assembling it.",
			"• The beam wings on the back are reproduced with clear parts."
		]
	},
